00:52:56,320 --> 00:53:00,120
‘能拦住一辆路虎的。’
'but nothing gets in the
way of a Land Rover.'

868
00:53:03,800 --> 00:53:06,150
不过，事实是…
Now, the thing is...

869
00:53:06,200 --> 00:53:10,270
那支广告虽然看起来激动人心，但恐怕
that advert, as exciting as
it looked, was, I'm afraid,

870
00:53:10,320 --> 00:53:12,710
是…可以说，
the result of... shall we say,

871
00:53:12,760 --> 00:53:14,470
电视的魔法在作祟，
the magic of television,

872
00:53:14,520 --> 00:53:18,350
因为路虎根本没自己把自己绞上去。
because the Land Rover
didn't winch itself up.

873
00:53:18,400 --> 00:53:21,590
前保险杠上的绞盘只把它拽出水面几尺，
The winch on the front bumper
pulled it the first few feet

874
00:53:21,640 --> 00:53:23,390
随后它其实是被
out of the water,

875
00:53:23,440 --> 00:53:26,270
隐藏在坝顶的那台更大的绞盘拖上去的。
but then it was actually hauled
the rest of the way up

876
00:53:26,320 --> 00:53:29,640
所以我想你们大概已经猜到接下来要干嘛了。
by a much bigger winch hidden
at the top of the dam.

877
00:53:30,800 --> 00:53:34,430
作为向Land Rover Defender的致敬，
So I think you can probably
see what's coming next.

878
00:53:34,480 --> 00:53:37,150
我们要把这场特技重新来一次，弄得更狠。
As our tribute to the
Land Rover Defender

879
00:53:37,200 --> 00:53:40,720
好好来个正儿八经的翻版。
we are going to redo
that stunt properly.

880
00:53:45,600 --> 00:53:47,720
哦…天哪。
Oh... God.

881
00:53:49,880 --> 00:53:53,880
我要爬的水坝是威尔士的克莱文。
The dam I'll be climbing
is Claerwen in Wales.

882
00:53:54,920 --> 00:53:57,710
它宽1200英尺，而且，
It's 1,200 feet wide and,

883
00:53:57,760 --> 00:54:01,910
更让人担心的是，它有200英尺高。
more worryingly for
me, 200 feet high.

884
00:54:01,960 --> 00:54:04,550
更糟的是，
To make things worse,

885
00:54:04,600 --> 00:54:08,430
我这辆要用的路虎已经64岁了。
the Land Rover I'll be
using is 64 years old.

886
00:54:08,480 --> 00:54:13,230
所以，为了完成他们在电视广告里根本做不到的事，
So, in order to do what they
never managed in the TV advert,

887
00:54:13,280 --> 00:54:15,760
我们加了点小改动。
we've added some bits.

888
00:54:17,680 --> 00:54:21,430
他们拍那个广告时，根本没有足够大的绞盘，
When they made that advert there
wasn't a winch around big enough

889
00:54:21,480 --> 00:54:25,430
装不下爬这么大水坝所需的整条钢索。
to take on board all the cable
you need to go up a big dam.

890
00:54:25,480 --> 00:54:28,710
于是我们——啊不是杰里米和我，而是别人——
So we - well, not Jeremy
and me, somebody else -

891
00:54:28,760 --> 00:54:31,200
造了个巨无霸绞盘。
has built this ginormous one.

892
00:54:32,320 --> 00:54:35,950
还有发动机这事儿。
Then there's the matter
of the engine.

893
00:54:36,000 --> 00:54:41,150
你看，这玩意儿一上坡就会垂直上升，
You see, when this thing starts to
go up the dam it will go vertical,

894
00:54:41,200 --> 00:54:45,510
那时候前面的发动机就会熄火。
and at that point the engine
at the front will cut out.

895
00:54:45,560 --> 00:54:48,590
这就麻烦了，因为我们得靠发动机来给绞盘供能。
Problem, because we need the
engine to power the winch.

896
00:54:48,640 --> 00:54:50,910
解决方案……
Solution...

897
00:54:50,960 --> 00:54:53,070
给绞盘装个专用的第二发动机。
a second engine just for the winch.

898
00:54:53,120 --> 00:54:56,030
最妙的是，这玩意儿还能转动。
Best of all this is
built so it can pivot.

899
00:54:56,080 --> 00:54:59,590
当路虎垂直上去时，这绞盘还能保持水平。
As the Land Rover goes
vertical this stays level.

900
00:54:59,640 --> 00:55:03,590
不过，这一切根本没让我感觉安心，
None of this gave me
much comfort, however,

901
00:55:03,640 --> 00:55:06,240
站在底部那会儿。
when I was standing at the bottom.

902
00:55:07,480 --> 00:55:09,430
噢，真他妈的倒霉。
Oh, bloody hell.

903
00:55:09,480 --> 00:55:11,590
这坡简直更陡啊
It's much steeper

904
00:55:11,640 --> 00:55:15,270
比广告里那座水坝还陡。
than the other dam in the advert.

905
00:55:15,320 --> 00:55:18,990
我瞬间以为自己可以躲开了，
For a brief moment I thought
I was off the hook

906
00:55:19,040 --> 00:55:22,230
因为起点看起来根本上不去。
because the start point looked
completely inaccessible.

907
00:55:22,280 --> 00:55:26,070
可惜制作组已经想好了这点。
Sadly, the producers
had thought of that.

908
00:55:26,120 --> 00:55:28,280
我真讨厌这些爱搞事儿的。
I hate problem solvers.

909
00:55:31,160 --> 00:55:34,030
而这只是个小前菜而已。
And this is just a
little amuse-bouche.

910
00:55:34,840 --> 00:55:37,670
最终，我就位了。
Eventually, I was in place.

911
00:55:37,720 --> 00:55:41,040
绞盘的钢索已经绑在顶上。
The winch cable was
attached to the top.

912
00:55:44,000 --> 00:55:46,600
于是该动手了。
And it was time to begin.

913
00:55:48,120 --> 00:55:51,710
记住，那就是后面的发动机在给绞盘供能，
That's the engine in the back
that powers the winch, remember,

914
00:55:51,760 --> 00:55:53,110
因为角度的缘故。
cos of the angle.

915
00:55:53,160 --> 00:55:56,230
呃…我真想想点别的事儿说或者干。
Um... I'd love to think of
something else to say or do.

916
00:55:56,280 --> 00:55:59,390
想不出来，我就先撤。于是，呃…
I can't, so I'm going
to go. So, um...

917
00:55:59,440 --> 00:56:01,240
好了，我要出发了。
Right, here I go.

918
00:56:06,000 --> 00:56:08,070
噢，绞盘开始紧绷了。
Oh, it's tensioning up.

919
00:56:11,120 --> 00:56:12,990
到这儿算是还行。
This is OK so far.

920
00:56:16,800 --> 00:56:19,440
哦！找到了。
Oh! There it is.

921
00:56:21,360 --> 00:56:23,750
哎呀，天哪！
Oh, my God!

922
00:56:23,800 --> 00:56:27,800
哦！哎呦呀！哦！
Oh! Oh-ho-ho! Oh!

923
00:56:33,040 --> 00:56:35,150
我知道它慢。
I know it's slow.

924
00:56:35,200 --> 00:56:39,080
再快点我就得把绞车马达全烧掉，废了。
Any faster and I risk burning out
all the winch motors and things.

925
00:56:40,240 --> 00:56:43,880
而且大坝的正面还有点问题。
Plus, there was an issue with
the face of the dam itself.

926
00:56:45,360 --> 00:56:49,070
广告里那的是光滑混凝土，这儿却是粗糙的石头。
The one on the advert was smooth
concrete, this is rough stone.

927
00:56:49,120 --> 00:56:51,590
我根本没把这算进去。
I didn't take that into account.

928
00:56:53,800 --> 00:56:56,350
我得在这些石头间穿梭
What I've got to do is
steer between these rocks

929
00:56:56,400 --> 00:56:58,150
它们从墙面冒出来的地方。
where they stick out from the face.

930
00:56:58,200 --> 00:57:01,630
哦！车子在抽动。
Oh! It's jerking.

931
00:57:01,680 --> 00:57:03,430
我得读一下地面情况。
I'm having to read the surface.

932
00:57:03,480 --> 00:57:05,350
叮当！哦！
CLANG! Oh!

933
00:57:06,920 --> 00:57:11,120
这垂直越野给我整出了新麻烦。
This vertical off-roading
gave me another problem.

934
00:57:12,760 --> 00:57:17,790
因为这辆路虎在自个儿的绞车上自拔，
Because the Land Rover is winching
itself up on its own winch,

935
00:57:17,840 --> 00:57:21,270
钢缆必须均匀地卷进绞盘。
the cable has to feed
evenly onto the drum.

936
00:57:21,320 --> 00:57:24,520
要是卷得不均匀，全部都毁了。
If it doesn't do that,
everything gets ruined.

937
00:57:25,360 --> 00:57:30,710
我根本看不见绞盘，所以上面那帮制作人得给我指点。
I couldn't see the drum, so, up top,
the producers were spotting for me.

938
00:57:30,760 --> 00:57:33,230
请把姿势挺直，理查德。
Straighten up, please, Richard.

939
00:57:36,960 --> 00:57:38,430
啊…
Ah...

940
00:57:38,480 --> 00:57:40,160
哦…
Oh...

941
00:57:42,800 --> 00:57:44,000
哦…
Oh...

942
00:57:46,440 --> 00:57:49,710
因为它慢得离谱，我有时间思考要是……会怎样。
Because it's so slow I've got time
to think about what would happen if...

943
00:57:49,760 --> 00:57:52,150
我不敢想，我现在吓坏了。
I can't, I daren't.
I am now terrified.

944
00:57:52,200 --> 00:57:55,390
我现在彻底石化了。
I am now absolutely petrified.

945
00:57:55,440 --> 00:57:56,640
哦…
Oh...

946
00:57:59,360 --> 00:58:03,240
过了半程后，情况更糟了。
Past the halfway point it
started to get even worse.

947
00:58:04,880 --> 00:58:07,750
我能感觉前轮现在变得异常轻…
I can feel the front wheels
now going very light...

948
00:58:07,800 --> 00:58:12,350
因为……那儿凹进去，车身凹进去的地方…
because... where it goes concave,
where it bellies in like that...

949
00:58:12,400 --> 00:58:16,040
我的绞车绳把车头拽离地面。哦！
my winch cable is pulling the front
of the car off the ground. Oh!

950
00:58:17,600 --> 00:58:20,700
我根本无法形容那种糟心感受。
And I can't tell you
how horrible that feels.

951
00:58:21,400 --> 00:58:23,630
哦呦！
Oh-ho!

952
00:58:23,680 --> 00:58:25,830
停，停，停。
Stop, stop, stop.

953
00:58:25,880 --> 00:58:28,150
我要停了，我要停了。
I'm stopping, I'm stopping.

954
00:58:32,280 --> 00:58:35,110
~ 老实说，兄弟，你还有大约20秒，我
~ 哔——
~ 吓得要命，行吧？
~ Honestly, mate, you've
got about 20 seconds, I'm
~ BLEEP
~ scared, OK?

955
00:58:35,160 --> 00:58:36,830
我说的是真话。
And I mean it.

956
00:58:38,360 --> 00:58:41,790
行，先别想它，先别想它。嗯……这个……
OK, take your mind off it, take
your mind off it. Um... this...

957
00:58:41,840 --> 00:58:43,750
砰！啊！
THUMP! Ah!

958
00:58:43,800 --> 00:58:46,670
这座大坝后面的水可以供给伯明翰
The water behind this dam
can supply Birmingham

959
00:58:46,720 --> 00:58:50,310
每天七千九百万加仑。
with 79 million gallons a day.

960
00:58:50,360 --> 00:58:52,390
~ 谁在乎
~ 哔——
~ 现在？
~ Who gives a
~ BLEEP
~ right now?

961
00:58:52,440 --> 00:58:54,710
没事，一切都好。
It's all right, we're good.

962
00:58:59,760 --> 00:59:01,900
现在真的垂直了。
It's really vertical now.

963
00:59:05,840 --> 00:59:07,240
哎呀，天呐。
Oh, God.

964
00:59:09,440 --> 00:59:11,110
我能听到那根线的…
I can hear the lines...

965
00:59:11,160 --> 00:59:14,260
我真的能听到那根钢丝的紧绷声。
I can actually hear the
tension in that wire.

966
00:59:17,480 --> 00:59:19,030
我一上到顶，
As I get to the top,

967
00:59:19,080 --> 00:59:20,790
那绳子就没那么结实了。
the cable becomes less strong.

968
00:59:20,840 --> 00:59:23,590
部分原因是，除了Land Rover和我的重量，
Partly because, as well as the
weight of the Land Rover and me,

969
00:59:23,640 --> 00:59:27,640
它还得背着它自己和卷扬机的重量。
it has to be carrying the weight
of itself and the winch.

970
00:59:33,080 --> 00:59:36,990
哎呀，我太依赖别人的玩意儿了。
Oh, God, I'm depending so much
on things made by other people.

971
00:59:37,040 --> 00:59:41,230
每一个零件——比如刹车，负责阻止卷扬机放线，
Every single part now - the brake
that stops the winch feeding out,

972
00:59:41,280 --> 00:59:43,520
发动机——所有东西。
the engine - everything.

973
00:59:45,120 --> 00:59:47,750
在这份无法形容的恐惧面前
In the face of unutterable terror

974
00:59:47,800 --> 00:59:51,200
我终于快到顶了。
I was, finally, nearing the top.

975
00:59:53,160 --> 00:59:56,560
我们差不多就完成了，我差点搞定了。
We have nearly done this,
I've nearly cracked it.

976
00:59:56,960 --> 00:59:59,430
两百英尺的几乎垂直的岩壁。
200 feet of near vertical rock.

977
01:00:04,880 --> 01:00:08,120
再几英寸，卷几下绳子就行了。
Just a few inches, another
few turns on the winch.

978
01:00:12,600 --> 01:00:14,230
真是绝妙的方式……
What a fantastic way...

979
01:00:14,280 --> 01:00:16,590
向这车致敬……
to pay tribute...

980
01:00:16,640 --> 01:00:19,470
向这车……什么？
to the car... What?

981
01:00:19,520 --> 01:00:23,710
就在这时，制作组扔下了坏消息。
It was at this point the
producers broke the bad news.

982
01:00:23,760 --> 01:00:26,590
因为卷扬机绳子系的地方，
Because of where the winch
cable was attached,

983
01:00:26,640 --> 01:00:31,830
Land Rover根本爬不上那块平坦的坝顶。
the Land Rover wouldn't be able to
climb over onto the flat dam top.

984
01:00:31,880 --> 01:00:34,720
于是只能意味着一件事。
And this meant only one thing.

985
01:00:36,720 --> 01:00:39,320
我只能得下去。
I'm going to have to go back down.

986
01:00:39,960 --> 01:00:42,960
得把它卷下来，沿着坝下去。
I'm going to have to
winch it down the dam.

987
01:00:45,560 --> 01:00:47,560
我真的得去撒泡尿！
I really need a piss!

988
01:00:55,160 --> 01:00:58,110
谢谢，没事儿。
Thank you. It was nothing.

989
01:00:58,160 --> 01:00:59,830
没事儿。
It was nothing.

990
01:01:01,320 --> 01:01:04,710
所以……你失败了。
So... you failed.

991
01:01:04,760 --> 01:01:06,310
好吧，我差点到顶。
Well, I almost got to the top.

992
01:01:06,360 --> 01:01:08,750
是啊，但你又直接掉回去。
Yeah, but then you just came
straight back down again.

993
01:01:08,800 --> 01:01:12,030
抱歉，哈蒙德，如果我说‘我要开车去布里斯托尔’，然后
I'm sorry, Hammond, if I said, "I'm
going to drive to Bristol," and then

994
01:01:12,080 --> 01:01:16,070
差点儿到布里斯托尔又回家了，那根本算不上去布里斯托尔。
got NEARLY to Bristol and came home
again, that's NOT going to Bristol.

995
01:01:16,120 --> 01:01:18,990
看重点，我给了Land Rover Defender
Look, the main thing is I
gave the Land Rover Defender

996
01:01:19,040 --> 01:01:22,790
~ 一个体面的告别。
~ 是啊，但他们现在在研发新Defender
~ a fitting sendoff.
~ Yeah, but they're working
on a new Defender now

997
01:01:22,840 --> 01:01:25,710
而且看起来完全和旧的一个样。
and it looks EXACTLY
the same as the old one.

998
01:01:25,760 --> 01:01:30,230
所以你说要开车爬到坝顶，结果根本没去，
So you said you'd drive to the
top of a dam, which you didn't,

999
01:01:30,280 --> 01:01:34,190
只为了向那辆你说快报废的车致敬，结果根本没死。
to pay tribute to a car that you
said was about to die, but it's not.

1000
01:01:34,240 --> 01:01:35,670
是啊。
Yeah.

1001
01:01:35,720 --> 01:01:39,430
好啊，那就是说你是个骗子，还把我们的时间全浪费了。
Well, that means you're a liar and
you've completely wasted our time.

1002
01:01:39,480 --> 01:01:41,110
嗯。
Yeah.

1003
01:01:41,160 --> 01:01:43,270
说到这惊天大新闻，我恐怕得说结束啦。
And on that bombshell, I'm
afraid it's time to end.

1004
01:01:43,320 --> 01:01:45,990
下周恢复正常播出。
Next week normal service is resumed.

1005
01:01:46,040 --> 01:01:48,470
詹姆斯和我故意来一堆撞车。
James and I have a lot
of crashes on purpose.

1006
01:01:48,520 --> 01:01:51,600
希望到时能再见到各位。谢谢观看，晚安！
Hopefully we shall see you then.
Thank you for watching, good night!

